cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this paper or its Lean formalization, please cite this work."
title: "Quantum unique ergodicity and the critical crossover for 1-d Gaussian band matrices"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Ghosal"
    given-names: "Promit"
  - family-names: "Remy"
    given-names: "Guillaume"
abstract: >-
  Lean 4 formalization of quantum unique ergodicity for bulk eigenvectors of 1-d complex Gaussian block band
  matrices when W^2/N tends to infinity, of the unique critical joint law of eigenvalues and eigenvector profiles
  when N/W^2 tends to tau in (0, infinity), and of its sine and Poisson endpoints.
keywords:
  - "random band matrices"
  - "quantum unique ergodicity"
  - "localization-delocalization transition"
  - "Lean 4"
  - "formalized mathematics"
repository-code: "https://github.com/AxiomMath/BandMatrixQUE"
url: "https://github.com/AxiomMath/BandMatrixQUE"
license: "Apache-2.0"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-11"
